      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW XHANI (5) goes very well here starting seven times for three wins and three minors. Placed last time (30.59) at The Meadows in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten a neck. Looks suited here and rates on top. ZIPPING SMEE (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at The Meadows over 525m behind Paw Gertrude (30.88) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Cannot be underestimated. PAW QUIVER (2) flew the lids and led throughout to score a most impressive win by 7 lengths at The Meadows over 525m (30.28). One of main contenders. CRUISING JAMIE (8) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
